      ],
      "source": "https://westlakehistory.com/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "West Lake Hills spans 2,560 acres and boasts roughly 40 miles of public streets, making it a compact community.",
